---
import { EXPERIENCES } from "../../../const";
import ExperienceList from "./ExperienceList/index.astro";
---

<div
  class="w-full max-w-[1440px] px-12 2xl:px-4 flex flex-col justify-center items-start py-12"
>
<div class="mb-20">
    
  <div class="text-[32px] font-bold text-left mb-4">Experiences</div>
  <p class="text-[18px]">
    Over the years, I’ve had the opportunity to explore and work across a
    diverse range of industries—not only in the tech space, but also in sales,
    customer service, and other dynamic environments. This broad experience has
    allowed me to develop a well-rounded skill set, adapt quickly to new
    challenges, and understand the unique demands of different sectors.
  </p>

</div>
  <ExperienceList />
</div>
